Z||000000||fiero56||10-09-2000||10:36 PM||||Arizona residents, particularly those on the south side, directly on the Mexico border. What is it like down there weather-wise? I know it's hot, but everyone I talk with says "but it's a dry heat". Yeah right, whats "dry heat" like? How does your Fiero fare with the heat in the summer. Does it do ok, or are there certain changes that should be performed(t'stat, radiator fan, etc)for proper operation and operating temp? How long does a paint job last in the sun down there? Whats the weather like year round? Just curious.||||reg||10
